title: AskJobStart
---
<<declare $firstTime = true>>
<<declare $currentQuestion = 0>>
<<declare $totalQuestions = 3>>
<<declare $nCorrects = 0>>
<<declare $selection = 0>>
<<declare $question = "">>
<<declare $choiceA = "">>
<<declare $choiceB = "">>
<<declare $choiceC = "">>
<<declare $choiceD = "">>
<<declare $correct = 0>>
<<declare $passExam = false>>
<<if $firstTime == true>>
    <<set $firstTime to false>>
    <<jump FirstAsk>>
<<else>>
    <<jump SorryAdvancedQuestions>>
<<endif>>

===

title: FirstAsk
---
Museum Director: Welcome to the Thomas Edison Museum. How can I help you?
Fred: I'm Fred Donnitoly, and I'm here for the job.
Museum Director: Do you really want to work here?
Fred: Yeah, I'm very enthusiastic.
Museum Director: Okay, do you like the history of Thomas Edison?
Fred: Uhm, sure. I don't LIKE his history...
Fred: I LOVE anything related to Thomas Edison!
Museum Director: Sounds good. Mr. Donnitoly, in what year was Thomas Edison born?
Fred: Ehh...
-> 1985
-> Can I use the "Call a Friend" lifeline?
-> I know it, I just don't want to say it.
MuseumDirector: That's what I thought — you know nothing about Thomas Edison.
MuseumDirector: Sorry, Mr. Donnitoly, I can't give you the job.
<<jump SorryAdvancedQuestions>>
===

title: SorryAdvancedQuestions
---
Fred: Can we try the questions again?
MuseumDirector: My questions are too advanced for you. Excuse me, I'm very busy right now.
===




title: ExamAsk
---
<<set $currentQuestion to 0>>
<<set $nCorrects to 0>>
<<set $selection to 0>>
MuseumDirector: Okay, so you think you're ready?
Fred: I was born ready.
MuseumDirector: Let's start.
<<jump NextQuestion>>
===



title: NextQuestion
---
<<if $currentQuestion >= $totalQuestions>>
    <<jump ExamFinished>>
<<endif>>
<<set $currentQuestion to $currentQuestion + 1>>
MuseumDirector: {$question}
-> A- {$choiceA}
    <<set $selection to 1>>
    <<jump CheckAnswer>>
-> B- {$choiceB}
    <<set $selection to 2>>
    <<jump CheckAnswer>>
-> C- {$choiceC}
    <<set $selection to 3>>
    <<jump CheckAnswer>>
-> D- {$choiceD}
    <<set $selection to 4>>
    <<jump CheckAnswer>>
===

title: CheckAnswer
---
<<if $selection == $correct>>
    <<set $nCorrects to $nCorrects + 1>>
<<endif>>
<<jump NextQuestion>>
===


title: ExamFinished
---
<<if $nCorrects == $totalQuestions>>
    <<jump Congrats>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Fail>>
<<endif>>
===


title: Fail
---
<<set $passExam to false>>
MuseumDirector: You fail.
MuseumDirector: You got only {$nCorrects} of {$totalQuestions}
===



title: Congrats
---
<<set $passExam to true>>
MuseumDirector: All corrects.
MuseumDirector: All corrects, congratulation Mr Donnitoly the job is yours
Fred: Wonderful!
===
